      "en": "and because he practiced the same trade, he lived with them and worked, for by trade they were tent makers.",
      "ko": "업이 같으므로 함께 거하여 일을 하니 그 업은 장막을 만드는 것이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e41b78d99f50402de86468276389cc5a767dfcfeaa93bb19fcd680a9a7e4a088",
      "translation_text_hash": "fa5ce83793ad068740ac7d299bad7ed5241bf479034701e9e8022bb94dae713e",
