      "en": "This man had been instructed in the way of the Lord; and being fervent in spirit, he spoke and taught accurately the things concerning Jesus, although he knew only the baptism of John.",
      "ko": "그가 일찍 주의 도를 배워 열심으로 예수에 관한 것을 자세히 말하며 가르치나 요한의 세례만 알 따름이라",
      "source_text_hash": "c4639393efbee0e1fa34998820f71077c37850ec5d6ee4b45a21e0b87f8035cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "8a805527be043d4b209d138bdbb8d983db257ff4d7410df322d6d63e6d80ac09",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
