      "en": "When he had determined to pass over into Achaia, the brothers encouraged him; and wrote to the disciples to receive him. When he had come, he greatly helped those who had believed through grace;",
      "ko": "아볼로가 아가야로 건너가고자 하니 형제들이 저를 장려하며 제자들에게 편지하여 영접하라 하였더니 저가 가매 은혜로 말미암아 믿은 자들에게 많은 유익을 주니",
      "source_text_hash": "d28c8f8e301913b1709eec6dbcedf580c5db9e734187e93799b816bf684d8d67",
      "translation_text_hash": "05de864ee57f05947dec0858a6d430426c20342e0f19948132c5fcfaff1aabb9",
